<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46735" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠέριος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἦρι</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>early, at</i> or <i>with early
				morn</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠερίη δ᾽ ἀνέβη μέγαν οὐρανόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.497
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				557
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.7
			</span></i> (Sch. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐαριναί</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.52
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.417
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			 later, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠήρ</span>) <i>misty,
				dimly seen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arat.
				349
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.580
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.1239
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>high in air</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠ. Γεράνεια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simon.
					114
				</span></i>
			; of birds, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>C.</u>
				1.380
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>H.</u>
				3.203
			</span></i>; of flying-fish, ib.<i><span class="en">
				1.430
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					6.180
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Arch.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nonn.
				<u>D.</u>
				7.315
			</span></i>, al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>airy, air-like</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῦρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Vict.</u>
					1.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
